p missing harry potter  if the wizarding world is missing a  piece without daniel radcliffe involved  can the hunger games prequel draw an  audience without j-law let us know what  you think in the comments  francis lawrence who directed catching  fire and both parts of mockingjay  will be returning to the director's  chair for the prequel  took it easy he'll be joined by suzanne  collins who is executive producing and  adapting the screenplay  along with co-screenwriter michael arndt  who also worked on the previous hunger  games films  nina jacobson and brad simpson will also  return as producers  but we know what you're really wondering  about is the cast there's a chance that  donald sutherland and eugenie bonduran  who played snow and tigris in the  original trilogy will make cameos as  their characters if the movie contains a  little flash forward  they're so fascinating it's fascinating  to see so far there's no official  casting news for the flick but fans have  been going crazy fan casting a young  president snow  our one fan favorite is adam driver who  could bring his skills as star wars  anti-hero kylo ren to the world of pan  am  a blonde haired atom driver huh that  would definitely look the part and can  make us sympathize a little with the  hard-to-love future president  will poulter is another popular pick and  he actually has experience with young  adult movie adaptations from starring in  the maze runner movies  stranger things star daiquiri montgomery  is another great choice  and we all know that he's great at  playing a villain you can root for but  let us know in the comment section down  below  who you would cast to play snow in the  prequel the prequel novel  might end up being a one and done kind  of deal but there's definitely a long  future ahead for the hunger games  franchise  lionsgate was already on top of this  book by the time colin started writing  it and are committed to keeping future  hunger games projects at lionsgate which  is no surprise considering it's one of  their biggest moneymakers  they've also licensed the rights to the  property for future use at amusement  parks and live shows which means  we might get to visit pan am in person  one day which  sounds both terrifying and kind of  amazing for now  we're gonna focus on the prequel movie  and hope that the odds for even more  hunger games content  are ever in our favor happy hunger games  you won't have to wait long to find out  what happened during the 10th annual  hunger games  the novel will be released on may 19th  but it'll probably be a couple of years  before the hunger games finally returns  to theaters  are you looking forward to getting to  know snow better or would you rather  focus  on another character let us know your  thoughts in the comments  don't forget to hit that like button and  subscribe to the things for more  thanks for watching we'll see you next  time  you
 

